{"title":"2010 CEMC Cayley Problems/Problem 3","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2010_CEMC_Cayley_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/d/1/fd1cd302d9f0ee13dcf4baf5293019f5cb90543d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x + \\sqrt{25} = \\sqrt{36}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"125\" height=\"21\" />, then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" /> equals\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/4/2/442918ffb4eee531288b42faab2027979c616c36.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{ (A) }\\ 1 \\qquad\\text{ (B) }\\ 2 \\qquad\\text{ (C) }\\ 3 \\qquad\\text{ (D) }\\ 4 \\qquad\\text{ (E) }\\ 11$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"397\" height=\"18\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2010_CEMC_Cayley_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/6/0/c606979127ea6753837f2b400812a432ea23f30d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$25 = 5^{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"61\" height=\"17\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/a/1/7a113d7dba877b518aedab68801963a0ec6504e5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$36 = 6^{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"61\" height=\"17\" />, so we have:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/d/1/fd1cd302d9f0ee13dcf4baf5293019f5cb90543d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x + \\sqrt{25} = \\sqrt{36}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"125\" height=\"21\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/9/b/b9b1cf89d67c36e70880b53bf1554fc155bbcf79.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x + 5 = 6$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"77\" height=\"15\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/2/1/021e337d2400f9d1b1e4e1f94db2bbaa13589846.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x = 6 - 5 = \\boxed{1}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -6px\" width=\"121\" height=\"25\" />\n</p><p>~anabel.disher\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2010_CEMC_Cayley\" title=\"2010 CEMC Cayley\">2010 CEMC Cayley</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2010_CEMC_Cayley_Problems&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2010 CEMC Cayley Problems (page does not exist)\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2010_CEMC_Cayley_Answer_Key\" title=\"2010 CEMC Cayley Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://cemc.math.uwaterloo.ca/contests/past_contests.html\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2010_CEMC_Cayley_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2010 CEMC Cayley Problems/Problem 2\">Problem 2</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2010_CEMC_Cayley_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"2010 CEMC Cayley Problems/Problem 4\">Problem 4</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2010_CEMC_Cayley_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2010 CEMC Cayley Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/